<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1542_5579.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser früntlich willig dienst, unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear>, liebs unnd guets vermoegend, zuvor
<lb n="3"/>fromm, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsamm</unclear> wyß, innsonders
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guett</unclear> fründt unnd gethrüw lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="5"/>Nachdem wir vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> tagen bricht empfangen,
<lb n="6"/>wie sich by üweren unnd unnseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>lieben Eidt: unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pundtsgnoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Drygen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Pündten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unruow</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogetragen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> daß etliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>wehr unnd waaffen und offnen zeichen sich er-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hept</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammen</unclear> geloffen. Habent
<lb n="12"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> bald umb abschaffung der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unruow</unclear>, inen
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernstlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeschriben</unclear>, unnd sy zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ruow</unclear> unnd
<lb n="14"/>einigkeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermanet</unclear>, Wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernemmend</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>aber mit sonderem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beduren</unclear>, das die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unruow</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empoerung</unclear> von tag zuo tag unnder inen
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoneme</unclear>, alß daß schon etliche vendli diß un-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruewigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volcks</unclear>, zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-114" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Chur</unclear></placeName> unnd im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-344" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Prättigow</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="19"/>gegen sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffgeworfen</unclear>, unnd noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">täglich</unclear> mehr
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">under</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schyn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syge</unclear> deß vatter-
<lb n="21"/>lanndts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fryheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerhalten</unclear> und zeschirmen,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammen</unclear> lauffind. Da man nit eigentlichen
<lb n="23"/>weißt, waß ir intention unnd vorhaben ist,
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bester</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eidtgnößischer</unclear> wolmeinung,
<lb n="25"/>unnd in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> die sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">langen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffzug</unclear> unnd
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umbhin</unclear> schicken nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlyden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mag</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">veroorschet</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>unnd entschloßen sind, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">morgens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> gethrüwen lieben <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen
<lb n="29"/>von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glaruß</unclear></orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechstgeseßne</unclear>, unnser raths-
<lb n="30"/>botschafft hinuf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pündt</unclear> zeschicken,
<lb n="31"/>diß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhür</unclear> mit der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilf</unclear> Gottes, so wyt müglich,
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeloßen</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhenigen</unclear> so sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhept</unclear>, durch
<lb n="33"/>ernstlichs unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuosprechen</unclear> unnder-
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stahn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuozestillen</unclear>, zuo hinlegung der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waaffen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1542_5580.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobewogen</unclear>, und die sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waeg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orden=</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>licher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unpartygischer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">handlung</unclear> ohne gwalts
<lb n="37"/>uebung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zerichten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darnaebent</unclear> aber,
